            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. After an employee has completed twelve (12) consecutive hours of work, the employee shall be paid two (2) times his or her pay rate for all additional consecutive hours worked, including those extending into the next workday. For the purposes of this Section E.3., time paid for but not worked shall not be counted in computing consecutive hours of work.",
