            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. For the purposes of this Section E.4., time paid for but not worked shall be counted in computing accumulated straight time hours. Time off from work which is paid for by the Union and excused by the Company shall also be counted in computing accumulated straight time hours. However, the total number of straight time hours which can be accumulated in any one day for the purpose of weekly overtime shall not exceed eight (8) hours.",
